"Don't be ridiculous. He's obviously an intruder. This is neither the time nor the place for jokes."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md02/0200320a00'>
//「無茶を言うな。どう見ても単に不審人物だ。
